WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:03.842
Here’s how to set up Delivery App Switcher.

00:00:03.842 --> 00:00:08.453
First, choose your apps. Then set up the button and notifications.

00:00:08.853 --> 00:00:13.501
In Select apps, check the apps you use and tap Save.

00:00:13.501 --> 00:00:19.120
Here, Baemin Connect, Vroong and Coupang Eats Delivery Partner are selected.

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:24.670
To show the floating button, allow the app to appear on top of other apps.

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:28.987
Read the prompt and tap OK to open Android settings.

00:00:29.387 --> 00:00:35.371
Find Delivery App Switcher in the list. Its switch is off in this example.

00:00:35.371 --> 00:00:39.487
Turn it on, then return to the app.

00:00:39.887 --> 00:00:44.848
In split mode, each section of the circle opens a different app.

00:00:44.848 --> 00:00:48.620
Tap the section for the app you want.

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:56.153
In cycle mode, each tap opens the next app in your selected list.

00:00:56.553 --> 00:01:00.075
In vertical mode, the app buttons are stacked.

00:01:00.075 --> 00:01:03.520
Tap the button for the app you want to open.

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:08.959
Use the sliders to adjust the button’s size and opacity.

00:01:08.959 --> 00:01:14.087
Drag the button to move it. The values shown are examples.

00:01:14.487 --> 00:01:19.516
Notification blinking and automatic switching need two permissions.

00:01:19.516 --> 00:01:23.253
First, tap Allow notification access.

00:01:23.653 --> 00:01:28.460
In Android’s notification access settings, find Delivery App Switcher.

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:33.020
The switch shown here is off. Turn it on and return to the app.

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:37.036
Next, tap Allow usage access.

00:01:37.036 --> 00:01:42.653
In Settings, grant usage access to Delivery App Switcher, then return.

00:01:43.053 --> 00:01:48.153
When both permissions are granted, you’ll see 2 of 2 complete.

00:01:48.153 --> 00:01:53.453
Tap Done. You can revoke these permissions in Settings at any time.

00:01:53.853 --> 00:01:58.164
Turn on blinking for notifications from your selected apps.

00:01:58.164 --> 00:02:02.892
The button blinks for up to 20 seconds and stops when you open the app.

00:02:02.892 --> 00:02:07.053
Order alerts and other notifications are treated alike.

00:02:07.453 --> 00:02:10.852
You can also turn on automatic switching.

00:02:10.852 --> 00:02:14.997
About one second after a notification arrives, its app opens.

00:02:14.997 --> 00:02:18.787
Frequent notifications can cause repeated switches.

00:02:19.187 --> 00:02:23.815
If the delivery app you’re viewing sends no phone notification, there’s nothing to detect.

00:02:23.815 --> 00:02:27.838
Delivery App Switcher doesn’t detect or accept assignments directly.

00:02:27.838 --> 00:02:31.553
It can’t guarantee fewer missed orders or higher earnings.

00:02:31.953 --> 00:02:36.794
Setup is complete. Choose the switching mode that works for you.

00:02:36.794 --> 00:02:42.753
Delivery App Switcher is independent and has no official affiliation with the delivery platforms.
